feel anxious or even panicked when dealing with charts and data, partly

10
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:57,420
because you lack confidence when choosing information, and partly because you

11
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:01,600
don't know how to organize or describe them, or where to start.

12
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,500
Everything seems too messy.

