151
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:10,820
They are no overview, overview with numbers, describing all data points, lack

152
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:16,940
of data grouping, incorrect tense, subject-verb disagreement, incorrect

153
00:12:16,940 --> 00:12:24,320
prepositions, excessive repetition, incorrect trend verbs, and one sentence per

154
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,160
data point.

